,"verse":45,"english":"Then Viśvāmitra said to my father, 'The descendants of Raghu, sons of Daśaratha, Rāma and Lakşmaņa are anxious to behold the bow.' Thus accosted by the Vipra, my father brought the bow, and showed that celestial bow to the princes.","alignment":{"type":"split","confidence":0.453,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-2-118-42","DUTT-2-118-43"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"2110045","sanskritFile":"Ram02.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"00584c1e31b69322d9fec76ae958ae558a397ef330f3f5686bd67329a02f030c","compact":"21e8d4a5626dc59515637f36c4bd38776142264a5a40d9a747a3203475793693","nasal":"1a1a26bbc5b60920dfdd4e05de30eaf3c7a94925a55907efc4e0d399e50ce2c5"}},{"id":"VRCE-2-110-46","kanda":2,"kandaId":"ayodhya","sarga":110,"verse":46,"english":"Thereupon, in the twinkling of an eye, bending it, the powerful (Raghava) stringed the bow and drew it.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.726,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-2-118-44"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"2110046","sanskritFile":"Ram02.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"781d281498c9c10b824bd9112782bef2d5bd374527bd6f0623f50fe5f4e8e0d8","compact":"eae41564424b3c99a1a1c62d952f30e27f2aeb8fbb60639c48c98ce34b8099b2","nasal":"28638d7cc30c16e0ae88669f44a23f9c15627e0c60d258df3ebbc3f4f5f35354"}},{"id":"VRCE-2-110-47","kanda":2,"kandaId":"ayodhya","sarga":110,"verse":47,"english":"And as he drew it vehemently, it broke in the middle in twain. And the sound of it was dreadful like to the bursting of a thunder-bolt.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.78,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-2-118-45"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"2110047","sanskritFile":"Ram02.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"1539bf30a2a6465c0f6efd9831e03ad74db70af81247f96a4425a60c330fbe1b","co